# FLIGHT DATA's map follows the vehicle as Mission Planner's Auto Pan check box does (CHK_autopan,
# ticked by default): the button at the map's top right ticks and unticks it. While it is ticked
# the vehicle is kept in the view's centre at the zoom the pilot has - mapview.rs's tests hold the
# rules - and a zoom does not untick it (the owner's bug, 2026-10-05).
# `GCSViews/FlightData.Designer.cs:2856-2864, GCSViews/FlightData.cs:1929-1933, 4242-4247`

screen fly
window 1600x1200
budget 5

expect map.following true
click map-follow
expect map.following false
click map-follow
expect map.following true
